<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Nafin interest rate for June 23.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Nafin interest rate for June 23.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state development bank Nacional Financiera (Nafin) said on Tuesday its so-called &quot;Tasa Nafin&quot; interest rate for June was set at 23.86 pct.</p>
<p>The rate fell from May's rate of 24.88 percent, Nafin said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 729-7903))</p>
</text>
